# Pruebas de API - Autenticación

## 1. Login (Admin)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@importservices.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

## 2. Login (Ventas)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ventas@importservices.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

## 3. Obtener usuario autenticado (requiere token)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer TU_TOKEN_AQUI

###

## 4. Registrar nuevo usuario (requiere ser Admin)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN_DE_ADMIN

{
  "email": "nuevo@importservices.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "name": "Nuevo Usuario",
  "role": "SALES"
}

###

## 5. Logout
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer TU_TOKEN_AQUI

###

## 6. Health Check
GET http://localhost:3000/api/health
